. Separately, the Company has entered an exclusive manufacturing arrangement, including leasing of facilities of Segno Ceramics Private Limited (Segno), intended to expand its ability to serve customers with better logistics in the hinterland.","mdna":{},"risks":{},"as_of":"","concallIntel":{}},"topics":{"one_liner":{"title":"One Liner (RHP)","body":"Regency Ceramics Limited manufactures and trades ceramic, vitrified and allied tile products in India.","src":"drhp","as_of":""},"business_model":{"title":"Business (RHP)","body":"The Company is engaged in the business of manufacturing and trading of ceramic, vitrified and allied tile products, operating through its own manufacturing facilities. It has entered into an exclusive manufacturing arrangement, including leasing of facilities of Segno Ceramics Private Limited, to serve customers more efficiently with better logistics in the hinterland.","src":"drhp","as_of":""},"group_structure":{"title":"Related (RHP)","body":"[{\"name\": \"Segno Ceramics Private Limited\", \"relation\": \"related party\", \"note\": \"Exclusive manufacturing arrangement with the Company, including leasing of facilities, to serve customers more efficiently with better logistics in the hinterland.\"}, {\"name\": \"Mrs. Radhika Prasad Narala\", \"relation\": …","src":"drhp","as_of":""},"demand_drivers":{"title":"Mdna (RHP)","body":"Management cites fluctuations in raw material prices, energy costs, logistics expenses and competitive market conditions as ongoing operating challenges.","src":"drhp","as_of":""},"capex_expansion":{"title":"Expansion (RHP)","body":"The Company has refurbished one of its production lines and associated fixed assets; of its original 10 production lines, 6 have been scrapped after suffering damage the OEMs could not repair, with the delay in insurance settlement cited as the reason equipment could not be restored to production. Separately, the Company has entered an exclusive manufacturing arrangement, including leasing of facilities of Segno Ceramics Private Limited (Segno), intended to expand its ability to serve customers with better logistics in the hinterland.","src":"drhp","as_of":""},"risks":{"title":"Risks (RHP)","body":"- The Company reported a Loss After Tax for the year and has been incurring losses for several quarters, driving increased working-capital requirements and dependence on promoter funding.\n- The Company is availing large unsecured, interest-free loans from its Promoter/Non-Executive Director and its Managing Director & CFO (up to Rs. 100 crore each) because it is facing constraints in accessing timely funding from conventional or confirmed external sources.\n- Of the Company's original 10 production lines, 6 have been scrapped due to damage that OEMs could not repair or provide spares for, with only one line refurbished; the delay in insurance settlement is cited as the reason equipment could not be restored to production.\n- A 2012 Industrial All Risks insurance claim remains under appeal; National Insurance Company has filed an Arbitration Appeal in the Madras High Court against the modified arbitral award, with the Company's recovery still contingent on the outcome.\n- Management flags fluctuations in raw material prices, energy costs and logistics expenses, alongside competitive market conditions, as ongoing pressures on operations.\n- Under a 2019 Memorandum of Settlement with the Regency Ceramics Staff and Workers Union, the Company is committed to allotting house sites at Yanam to displaced workers, pending Yanam Master Plan and layout approvals.","src":"drhp","as_of":""},"strategy":{"title":"Strategies (RHP)","body":"- Continued focus on operational efficiency, cost optimization, product quality enhancement and market expansion initiatives to sustain growth and profitability.\n- Introducing innovative designs and products in line with changing market trends and customer preferences.\n- Entered an exclusive manufacturing arrangement, including leasing of facilities of Segno Ceramics Private Limited, to serve customers more efficiently with better logistics in the hinterland.","src":"drhp","as_of":""}},"scorecard":{},"concallIntel":{},"segments":[],"themes":[],"ipo":{"summary":{},"analysis":{}},"coverage":{"concall":false,"deepDive":false,"drhp":true,"projection":false,"stage":false},"pageModel":{"schemaVersion":"company-page/1.0","layout":"vertical","identity":{"symbol":"REGENCERAM","name":"REGENCY CERAMICS LTD.","sector":"Consumer Durables","industry":"Consumer Durables"},"coverage":{"deepDive":false,"drhp":true,"stage":false,"priceHistory":true,"themes":false,"concall":false},"adapters":{"deepDive":{"available":false,"profile":"none","sections":{}},"drhp":{"available":true,"structured":true,"profile":"drhp","sections":{"case":true,"business":true,"financials":true,"execution":false,"ownership":true,"risks":true,"peers":true,"listing":false,"verdict":false}}},"hero":{"oneLiner":"Regency Ceramics Limited manufactures and trades ceramic, vitrified and allied tile products in India.","businessQuality":null,"sector":"Consumer Durables","industry":"Consumer Durables"},"sections":[{"id":"business","label":"Business","renderer":"drhpBusiness","available":true,"completeness":"full","sourceType":"drhp"},{"id":"case","label":"Investment Case","renderer":"drhpGenericCase","available":true,"completeness":"full","sourceType":"drhp"},{"id":"peers","label":"Industry & Peers","renderer":"drhpGenericPeers","available":true,"completeness":"full","sourceType":"drhp"},{"id":"financials","label":"Financials","renderer":"drhpFinancials","available":true,"completeness":"full","sourceType":"drhp"},{"id":"stage","label":"Stage Analysis","renderer":"stage","available":true,"completeness":"partial","sourceType":"momentum"},{"id":"ownership","label":"Ownership & Governance","renderer":"drhpOwnership","available":true,"completeness":"full","sourceType":"drhp"},{"id":"risks","label":"Risks","renderer":"drhpGenericRisks","available":true,"